AME/Ztt compiler regression tests
================================

The specification baseline and experimental limitations are recorded once
in gcc/config/riscv/README.ztt. They apply to this directory and the matching
g++.target/riscv/ame suite. Individual tests document the rule under test
rather than repeating the specification commit.

Run these tests with RUNTESTFLAGS="ame.exp". Rule directories contain
independent test sources; shared headers and auxiliary translation units
are not separate test cases. Each test selects its own extension, profile
and relevant optimization options, including negative feature tests.

These are compiler tests, not SAIL/Spike joint-execution programs. Compile,
assembly and diagnostic PASS results alone do not establish numerical,
hardware or ABI conformance.
